{"id": "rijks-200113037", "status": "ok", "meta": "A ruined windmill without sails beside the water, in Herman Heuff's 1885 print held by the Rijksmuseum.", "about": "A ruined windmill with no sails stands at the water's edge. Farther back on the right stands another mill that still has its sails. Herman Heuff made this print in 1885, and it is in the Rijksmuseum.", "museum_record": "https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/nl/collectie/object/RP-P-1992-436--f3521b6f00f2c519b8d264076a7b8340", "inventory_number": "", "dimensions": "", "credit_line": "", "sources": ["https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/nl/collectie/object/RP-P-1992-436--f3521b6f00f2c519b8d264076a7b8340", "https://id.rijksmuseum.nl/200113037"], "check": "clean"}
