{"id": "rijks-200116863", "status": "ok", "meta": "A night view over a river landscape from a terrace in Bern, drawn by William Holman Hunt in 1875.", "about": "William Holman Hunt drew this night view over a river landscape from a terrace in Bern in 1875. An inscription on the sheet reads: Berne, from terrace of hotel where we first stayed on our wedding journey. The Rijksmuseum holds the drawing.", "museum_record": "https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/nl/collectie/object/RP-T-1953-114--06825be1772ee3b57d44801b61c9eeb9", "inventory_number": "", "dimensions": "", "credit_line": "", "sources": ["https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/nl/collectie/object/RP-T-1953-114--06825be1772ee3b57d44801b61c9eeb9", "https://id.rijksmuseum.nl/200116863"], "check": "clean"}
